COMMENT     PROVISIONAL REFSEQ: This record has not yet been subject to final
            NCBI review. The reference sequence is identical to J02147.
            assignment of coding region by consideration of open reading frames
            and by comparison of predicted mw to nucleoprotein mw. [Eur. J.
            Biochem. 116, 645-645 (1981)] is a
            major revision of [1], so the sequence shown below reflects only
            [2],[Eur. J. Biochem. 116, 645-645 (1981)]. [1] compared with
            grantham's data.
            Complete source information:
            influenza [2]: A/Puerto Rico/8/34 cdna to rna from human; [1],[Eur.
            J. Biochem. 116, 645-645 (1981)]:
            x31 (a laboratory recombinant containing the A/Puerto Rico/8/34
            nucleoprotein segment) cdna to rna, originally from human.
            COMPLETENESS: full length.
